{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1492367-mummy-princess-crossover-ideas","id":1492367,"title":"Mummy/Princess Crossover ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-05T08:17:34-07:00","id":1492367,"title":"Mummy/Princess Crossover ideas","content":"After taking a break with cofd to play other games and with the release of book of everlasting dead I've come back to my old chronicles group to see if they wanted to try it out.<br /> <br /> Turns out while I was out they got into princess something that I am not much in for. Fortunately the group and the gm gave me the option to play as a mummy.<br /> <br /> Things to note is beyond the lore stuff about princess I don't know anything else about princess and in return the group while they love chronicles weren't interested in mummy due to the descent mechanics and lore. Regardless we've both open minded enough to play the splats and I am curious if anyone here has any tips and tricks in this kind of crossover.<br /> <br /> To note I am split between trying the new guilds in particular a Deceiver and Maar-Kherit or playing a Mesen Nebu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T12:00:06-07:00","id":1492380,"title":"","content":"I haven't read the <i>Book of Lasting Death</i> yet, so I can't comment on the Deceived or Maar-Kherit. However, Mesen-Nebu and other Arisen can make for a fascinating mirror to Princesses. Both Splats are tied to justice, community and ideals, but they approach these subjects from drastically different angles. Princesses are meant to enact justice holistically in order to make the world a better place. This means they fight evil, but also protect the innocent, heal old wounds and reward good works. Mummies serve the Judges who embody punitive justice, and are possibly indifferent to prevention and redemption. Princesses are meant to build healthy communities based on personal bonds. Mummies create cults based on hierarchy - from Judges at the top to Mortals at the bottom. Princesses serve ideals they believe in, but are young and inexperienced, risking emotional burnout. Mummies are essentially slaves to their cause, but they have been made to withstand eternity, and have already served for lifetimes. Both may not have a full grasp on their identity - Princesses, because they're still children - Mummies, because they forgot much of what they lived through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T15:27:27-07:00","id":1492401,"title":"","content":"I never considered princesses to be foils with mummies especially seeing how a lot of people consider beast to be the complete opposite of princess.<br /> <br /> This does present me with new ideas especially with what to do with my judge and what guild my character is going into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}